Original Statement:
------------------
SELECT 
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DATE_SK,
  TPCDS.WEB_SALES.WS_SHIP_HDEMO_SK 
FROM 
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 
  INNER JOIN TPCDS.WEB_SALES 
  ON TPCDS.WEB_SALES.WS_SHIP_DATE_SK = TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DATE_SK 
WHERE 
  TPCDS.WEB_SALES.WS_SHIP_DATE_SK >= 2451267 AND 
  TPCDS.WEB_SALES.WS_WEB_PAGE_SK = 12


Optimized Statement:
-------------------
SELECT 
  Q1.D_DATE_SK AS "D_DATE_SK",
  Q2.WS_SHIP_HDEMO_SK AS "WS_SHIP_HDEMO_SK" 
FROM 
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 AS Q1,
  TPCDS.WEB_SALES AS Q2 
WHERE 
  (Q2.WS_SHIP_DATE_SK = Q1.D_DATE_SK) AND 
  (Q2.WS_WEB_PAGE_SK = 12) AND 
  (2451267 <= Q2.WS_SHIP_DATE_SK)

Explain level:    Explain from section

